  "reference": "Bahebulania 13",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būtūmami būsoga kūlī Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū witogwi bo nyadūgū ni būlamage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūgwība ū mhayo go wiza ng'holò ū kū bageni, nguno bangī babīta na kūchumbeela bamalaika mu būtūmana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ūbizūkwa a batungwa, ning'we mubize gītī mulī batungwa bichabo, na a babo bakūluhiagwa; mubize gītī mulī hamò nabo ū mu būluhi bo mu mīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwa nhoola shiigelile gūkūjiwe na banhū bose, nū būlīīlī bo batooleke yaya ū kūsosohajiwa, nguno ū Mulungu akūbinha nsango pye a bajingi na a bashihani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī yaya ū kwikala mukūhahaalīlaga sabo ū mu būpanga wing'we, ni shing'wigelagwe īsho mulī nasho. Nguno alīhaya gīkī, “Natīko kūkūleka nūūlū kūkwība na hado yaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose tūkūhayaga na būgimu gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya kūmalīja na būgīsha waho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū Mulungu wa mhola ūyo kūlwa mininga g'ilagane lya shiku jose akang'wenha kūfuma mu bafu ū Seeba wise Yesu, ū Ndīīmi Ntaale wa ng'holo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "leki amushikanye mu būlī mhayo gwawiza, mudūle kūbeeja īyo yīnyegije; nū mu bise agwīte ūyo gūlīnyeja mulī Kilisito Yesu; ūyo ikūjo līlī lyakwe we, shikū jose ja shiku jose: Alichene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badūgū nalīng'wikūmbīlīja ng'wiyūmīlīje nago ū mhayo gwa būkomeleja wenūbū, ū mu mihayo migehu īyo nang'wandīkīla yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managi gīkī ū ndūgū wise ū Timotheo walekelilwe, ūlū alangūhe ū kwiza, nakwiza nang'hwe ko, twize tūmubone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagīshagi pye a batongeeji bing'we, na a beela pye a bose; a bana Italia balīmugīsha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shigongo shibize hamò ning'we bose: Alichene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
